# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PERSONAL TRAINING DATA — never commit to the public template.
# The framework ships pristine versions under seed/; `npm run setup` copies them
# into these live paths on a fresh clone. Your real progress stays local only.
# (To back it up privately, point a separate PRIVATE repo at these paths.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/progress/*.yaml
/DASHBOARD.md
/reflections/
/backlog/issue-*.md
/backlog/_index.yaml
/interviews/sessions/
/practice/
/homework/
/projects/
/sprints/
/curriculum/lesson-plans/

# Keep the seeds themselves tracked (they live under seed/, unaffected above).
